# Generated project data
# Aplicacoes: versionamos o codigo-fonte (.py) das aplicacoes de exemplo e de
# avaliacao de seguranca; ignoramos caches e quaisquer outros artefatos.
assets/apps/*
!assets/apps/*.py
assets/certs/
# Dados: ignoramos o diretorio (que contem PDFs de CNH reais com PII) e
# versionamos apenas os datasets SINTETICOS usados na avaliacao.
assets/data/*
!assets/data/dataset_synthetic.csv
!assets/data/teste1.csv
smart-contract/manifests/
smart-contract/uploads/
smart-contract/executions/
smart-contract/deployments/
executor/executions/
vm_runtime/artifacts/
vm_runtime/input/
vm_runtime/output/

# VM and disk artifacts
*.img
*.iso
*.qcow2
*.raw
*.ext2
*.ext3
*.ext4
*.squashfs
